# vvaharness/codegraph/handle.py

`GraphHandle`: the live handle a scan carries from Stage 0 to the last stage that queries the code graph. It owns the workspace and must be closed once at the end of the scan.

Source: `vvaharness/codegraph/handle.py` (lines 1-41)
Executor: code
Called from: `vvaharness/codegraph/build.py` (created), `vvaharness/orchestrator/scan.py` (closed in its OnEveryExit), `vvaharness/codegraph/tools.py`

// src: vvaharness/codegraph/handle.py:28-41
GraphHandle {
  workspace: Workspace       // external: context_graph_sdk.api
  graph: CodeGraph           // external: context_graph_sdk.code_graph
  project_id: String
  node_count: Number | null = null
  edge_count: Number | null = null
  enrichers: String[] = []   // names of the graph enricher plugins that ran
}
fn GraphHandle.close():executor=code { workspace.close() }   // releases the workspace file lock and open query workers
